    given-names: "Chelsea"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Local retrieval, bounded inspection, and contracted DuckDB/Parquet ingestion of
  CMS hospital price-transparency JSON v3 files, with source-cited findings and
  methodology-safe rate representations. Payer adapters and published comparisons
  are planned, not implemented. Pre-release: version and date-released will be added
  with the first dated release.
